[node name="IntroStorybook" type="CanvasLayer" unique_id=1940806526]
process_mode = 3
layer = 60
script = ExtResource("1_i")
pages = PackedStringArray("[center][i]The Last Petal[/i][/center]\n\nLong ago, every dream was woven on a single Loom, and at its heart grew a flower — the Stellaria — whose petals held all we remember, imagine and feel.\n\nThen the Void crept in, thread by thread, and the petals fell. Only the last petal still clings.", "[center][i]The Weaver Wakes[/i][/center]\n\nYou are the Storyweaver, called from sleep to gather what was lost.\n\nThree threads remain — Memory, Imagination and Spirit. Hum to the old stones and they will rise to carry you; pull each thread back toward the Loom.", "[center][i]Before the Petal Falls[/i][/center]\n\nThrough golden meadows, a keeper's garden, a forgetting forest and a fleeing night...\n\nFind the three threads. Bring them to Noria's Loom. Make the Stellaria bloom — before the last petal lets go.")

